span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RealizedGain</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.898em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是当前持仓，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>w</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|w - w_0|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 是换手，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 是单位交易成本向量，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 是有效税率。这个公式解释了为什么税务敏感账户的再平衡天然更「黏」——只要漂移带来的效用改善小于成交与实现税的代价，最优解就是不动。实务上还会叠加「再平衡带宽」（漂移超过某阈值才动）与「税预算」（一年内允许实现的利得上限）等约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>实施缺口 = 纸面收益 − 真实组合收益，可分解为延迟、市场冲击、价差、佣金税费、机会成本；显性成本看对账单，隐性成本靠 TCA 与基准对比估算。</li>\n<li>市场冲击随订单占日成交量比例的平方根增长，逼出「拆单压冲击 vs 拖延担风险」的执行节奏取舍（Almgren–Chriss）。</li>\n<li>应税账户里税常是最大成本：2026 年长期资本利得 0%/15%/20%、短期并入普通所得；优先卖高税基批次、推迟跨年卖出、用税损收割抵减利得。</li>\n<li>税损收割受洗售规则约束（前后 30 天内不得买入实质相同证券），靠高相关替代标的维持暴露；ETF「实质相同」认定截至 2026 年 3 月仍无定论。</li>\n<li>直接指数化用更高换手换税务 alpha（股票约 1%–2% 税后超额），约 $250k 以上才结构性划算；ETF 则靠实物申赎获得被动税务效率。</li>\n<li>工程上把交易成本与实现税写进优化目标（惩罚项 + 再平衡带宽 + 税预算），让再平衡在「值得动」时才动。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"交易成本与税务：把纸面组合变成真实持仓的摩擦账","id":"交易成本与税务-把纸面组合变成真实持仓的摩擦账"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：实施缺口的成本分解","id":"核心概念-实施缺口的成本分解"},{"level":2,"text":"市场冲击：为什么交易量越大单位成本越高","id":"市场冲击-为什么交易量越大单位成本越高"},{"level":2,"text":"税务摩擦：实现盈利前先看税基","id":"税务摩擦-实现盈利前先看税基"},{"level":3,"text":"洗售规则：税损收割的红线","id":"洗售规则-税损收割的红线"},{"level":2,"text":"直接指数化：用换手换税务 alpha","id":"直接指数化-用换手换税务-alpha"},{"level":2,"text":"把成本与税务装进优化器","id":"把成本与税务装进优化器"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"再平衡策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation/implementation-and-management/rebalancing-strategies"},"next":{"title":"回测与陷阱：为什么漂亮的历史曲线大多是假象","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation/implementation-and-management/backtesting-and-pitfalls"}}